{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/9c7a09e2473932c085a0cbeba3a05405.avif?t=1760103182\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a thousand years of slumber, the world is no longer the same. Humanity has changed, civilizations have fallen\u2026 yet Easter Island remains silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying your retirement on this quiet island, all you have to do is keep clicking and harvesting dozens of different crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Let the ancient vampire\u2019s night harvest begin! \ud83c\udf1b\ud83e\udd87</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Basic Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking more tiles gives you access to new crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking boosts planting, watering, fertilizing, harvesting, and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your stamina lets you work longer in the field. (Stamina refills when you sleep.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer helps your crops grow 2x faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bats protect your crops from pests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your inventory lets you carry more crops to the market, allowing you to earn more points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sit back and enjoy discovering 55+\u00a0different crops.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/fb65e4be729260d5347c8c37778bdf23.poster.avif?t=1760103182\" width=448 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/fb65e4be729260d5347c8c37778bdf23.webm?t=1760103182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/fb65e4be729260d5347c8c37778bdf23.mp4?t=1760103182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn points by selling your harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5c3f8f2cf8451a4347385456e4b50548.poster.avif?t=1760103182\" width=448 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5c3f8f2cf8451a4347385456e4b50548.webm?t=1760103182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5c3f8f2cf8451a4347385456e4b50548.mp4?t=1760103182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919620?t=1760103182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919620?t=1760103182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/96de0208010b978b8cd3f2962d11220eb44c9775/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760103182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/96de0208010b978b8cd3f2962d11220eb44c9775/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760103182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3987720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_par